    SRC("Procopius, Buildings 1.1.46 (the golden chain); Narratio de aedificatione templi S. Sophiae 27, in Preger, T. (ed.) (1901). Scriptores originum Constantinopolitanarum. Leipzig: Teubner."),
    SRC("Agathias, Histories 5.9.2–5; John Malalas, Chronicle 18.146 and Theophanes, Chronographia AM 6051 (the collapse of 558 and the rebuilding)."),
